But if he's not Bartholomew Kuma, who the hell is he?

267
00:22:48,684 --> 00:22:50,624
Either way, we don't have time for this crap.

268
00:22:51,124 --> 00:22:54,844
If we don't get out of here, we're going to be even worse off than we are now.

269
00:22:54,844 --> 00:23:10,224
I am the most well-guarded and tight-lipped man alive.

270
00:23:10,584 --> 00:23:12,964
Nobody can break down my impenetrable defenses.

271
00:23:13,404 --> 00:23:14,304
Who are you?

272
00:23:14,304 --> 00:23:14,904
Ha!

273
00:23:15,164 --> 00:23:17,604
A secret I shall take to the grave with me if I must.

274
00:23:17,884 --> 00:23:21,404
But if you really must know, you may call me...

275
00:23:21,404 --> 00:23:24,904
On the next Wood Beast, an even stronger enemy appears.

276
00:23:25,184 --> 00:23:27,204
The battle-axe-carrying Centumater.

277
00:23:27,584 --> 00:23:29,264
I'm going to be king of the pirates!

